<title>FINLAND: LASSILA &amp; TIKANOJA SEES 1997 EARNINGS UP.</title>
<headline>LASSILA &amp; TIKANOJA SEES 1997 EARNINGS UP.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish plastic and cleaning equipment maker Lassila &amp; Tikanoja said on Wednesday it expected its full-year 1997 earnings to improve on the year-ago level, when it made profit before extras of 154 million markka.</p>
<p>&quot;The group's financial results for the current year are expected to be good and to improve on the previous year,&quot; the company said in a statement with its January-April results.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +3589 6805 0247, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
